    {
      "id": "cox-p03-b042",
      "action": "translate",
      "delivery": "text",
      "source": "Here r = (r, φ) while ψ±ℓ= A(r) exp(±iℓφ) comprises an\nenveloping function, A(r), and an azimuthal phase, exp(±iℓφ)\nwith topological charge ±ℓand carrying ±ℓℏof OAM per pho-\nton. The parameters, a, b and α control the relative amplitudes\nand phases between the polarisation components, producing all\nstates on a higher-order Poincare Sphere [72]. From this we can\nconstructed a four dimensional mode space containing four basis\nvector modes, i.e.,",
      "target": "有{{asset:r}}，而{{asset:psi}}由包络{{asset:envelope}}及方位相位{{asset:azimuthal}}组成，其拓扑荷为{{asset:charge}}，携带{{asset:oam}}的OAM/光子。参数{{asset:a}}、{{asset:b}}和{{asset:alpha}}控制两偏振分量的相对振幅与相位，生成高阶庞加莱球上的全部态[72]。由此可构成含四个基矢量模式的四维空间。",
      "required_assets": [
        "r",
        "psi",
        "envelope",
        "azimuthal",
        "charge",
        "oam",
        "a",
        "b",
        "alpha"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wrap-heading",
      "action": "translate",
      "delivery": "text",
      "source": "Wrapped math and split extraction blocks",
      "target": "B. 跨行公式与拆分变量",
      "required_assets": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cox-p02-b041",
      "action": "translate",
      "delivery": "text",
      "source": "where Hm(·) denotes the Hermite polynomials and ψmn(z) =\n(m + n + 1) tan−1(z/z0) is the Gouy phase shift. In this case,\nthe solution reduces to the fundamental Gaussian beam when\nm = n = 0.",
      "target": "其中{{asset:hm}}为厄米多项式，{{asset:psi-mn}}为古依相移。当{{asset:mn-zero}}时，解退化为基模高斯光束。",
      "required_assets": [
        "hm",
        "psi-mn",
        "mn-zero"
      ]
    },
